  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility and identification of action on social protection in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU is preparing a new Action on social protection as part of its MIP 2021-2027 under the priority area &#xbf;An inclusive and peaceful society&#xbf;. Following an initial mapping of the sector using the&amp;nbsp;significant material already available, including recent studies, the experts will assess where EU support could have a transformative impact.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
